## Dev node — clusters with beam00.lab, beam01.lab (Site A)
-name hecate_dev@host00.lab

## Shared cookie with Site A beam nodes
-setcookie 9ExkyysakEt8gR0SMQvI

## No heartbeat in dev (don't auto-restart on crash)
## -heart

## Interactive code server — required for in-VM plugin loading
-mode interactive

-smp auto
+A 64
+P 1048576
+Q 65536
+sbt db
+SDio 32
